    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scratch away at your leisure,\u00a0win big money and listen to\u00a0some gloomy generative\u00a0dark jazz!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who knows, maybe that\u00a0locked door will open at some\u00a0point and you can get out of\u00a0this strange gas station in the\u00a0middle of nowhere...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls: <br>Look around with the mouse <br>Click to move <br>Press I to open and close the inventory <br>Esc to quit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye on your energy bar\u00a0on the bottom of the screen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Options:</i> <br><i>Shift+0 to toggle between normal and performance mode</i> <br><i>Shift+Arrow Up/Down to adjust motion blur</i> <br><i>Shift+Arrow Left/Right to adjust mouse sensitivity</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 cinematic scratch ticket experience \ud83d\udcb0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 pre-rendered 360\u00b0 backgrounds\u00a0\ud83d\udcb0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 real-time algorithmically generated soundtrack\u00a0\ud83d\udcb0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 12 different scratch tickets\u00a0\ud83d\udcb0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 5 different energy drinks\u00a0\ud83d\udcb0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 relaxing solitude\u00a0\ud83d\udcb0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scratch away at your leisure,\u00a0win big money and listen to\u00a0some gloomy generative\u00a0dark jazz!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who knows, maybe that\u00a0locked door will open at some\u00a0point and you can get out of\u00a0this strange gas station in the\u00a0middle of nowhere...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls: <br>Look around with the mouse <br>Click to move <br>Press I to open and close the inventory <br>Esc to quit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye on your energy bar\u00a0on the bottom of the screen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Options:</i> <br><i>Shift+0 to toggle between normal and performance mode</i> <br><i>Shift+Arrow Up/Down to adjust motion blur</i> <br><i>Shift+Arrow Left/Right to adjust mouse sensitivity</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 cinematic scratch ticket experience \ud83d\udcb0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 pre-rendered 360\u00b0 backgrounds\u00a0\ud83d\udcb0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 real-time algorithmically generated soundtrack\u00a0\ud83d\udcb0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 12 different scratch tickets\u00a0\ud83d\udcb0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 5 different energy drinks\u00a0\ud83d\udcb0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 relaxing solitude\u00a0\ud83d\udcb0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "GRUBBY FINGERS is an experimental point-and-click game about scratching lottery tickets in a surreal gas station lost in the middle of nowhere. Enjoy atmospheric pre-rendered 360\u00b0 visuals, generative dark jazz, and a touch of mystery while chasing your next big win.",
